{"schema_version":"capability-task-v1","id":"task_holdout_long_context_02","dimension":"long_context","split":"task_holdout","family":"reference_chain_with_decoy","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"索引：工单 T18 指向设备 D4；T19 指向 D7；T20 指向 D2。设备：D2 位于机架 R8；D4 位于 R3；D7 位于 R1。机架：R1 属于区域 West；R3 属于区域 East；R8 属于区域 North。状态：T18 closed；T19 open；T20 open。备注：旧记录曾把 D2 写成 R5，已撤销。问题：开放工单中编号最大的工单位于哪个区域？只输出 {\"ticket\":字符串,\"device\":字符串,\"rack\":字符串,\"zone\":字符串}。"}],"max_output_tokens":56,"temperature":0},"reference_answer":{"ticket":"T20","device":"D2","rack":"R8","zone":"North"},"validator":{"type":"exact_json","expected":{"ticket":"T20","device":"D2","rack":"R8","zone":"North"}},"critical_decision_tokens":[{"id":"ticket","token_text":"T20","rationale":"开放工单中编号最大"},{"id":"rack","token_text":"R8","rationale":"使用有效设备记录而非撤销备注"},{"id":"zone","token_text":"North","rationale":"完成三级连接"}],"failure_conditions":["选择已关闭工单","使用已撤销 R5","任一连接跳转错误"]}
